Upstream ggml commit 46fc5b3b, "metal: support left and circular padding in GGML_OP_PAD",
rebased onto 36da5713, the ggml that Breeze-TTS-2.cpp v0.1.6 pins. Without it the Metal backend
rejects the left padding in Breeze's vocoder, and breeze-server aborts at warm-up with
"unsupported op 'PAD'". Only the ggml-metal-impl.h hunk needed rebasing, and the patch touches
only the Metal backend. Apply it in third_party/ggml with git apply. docs/machines.md has the build.

